        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The kobold scout is adjacent to at least one enemy.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The kobold scout Strides up to its Speed plus 5 feet and gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against reactions triggered by this movement. It must end this movement in a space that's not adjacent to any enemy.</p>",
